<title>USA: Dow Jones index fall 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones index fall 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 50 points Wednesday as profit taking chipped away at the index after Tuesday's first ever close above 6,600 points.</p>
<p>At 2;41 p.m. EST, the Dow was off 54.26 points to 6,546.40, triggering curbs on program trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
